============================================
Real IR Drop Signoff Report (17-6)
============================================
Design:  SHA256
Clock:   15ns (66.7MHz)
PDK:     sky130A (sky130_fd_sc_hd)
Corner:  tt_025C_1v80
Tool:    OpenROAD 26Q3 (analyze_power_grid)
Date:    2026-08-14
============================================

> 本报告为真实 analyze_power_grid 求解结果，替代 16-5c 的手算估算值。
> 原估算 ~43mV 过于保守；真实求解最坏单轨 4.32mV（VSS），仅占 180mV 单轨 budget 的 2.4%。
> 双轨合成 7.51mV 为保守上界（假设 VDD/VSS worst 共现），相对双轨各自 10% 合计 360mV 时占 2.1%。

=== 求解方法 ===

工具: OpenROAD analyze_power_grid (PSM solver)
电源网格: met4 (垂直 stripe, 1600dbu 宽) × met5 (水平 stripe, 1600dbu 宽)
电压源: 4 个 C4 bump per net，放置在 met4×met5 stripe 交点
  - VDD vsrc: vdd_vsrc.txt (4 点, 1.8V)
  - VSS vsrc: vss_vsrc.txt (4 点, 0.0V)
求解规模: 47296 components, 20416 power pin connections

=== VDD 分析结果 ===

Net              : VDD
Corner           : default (tt_025C_1v80)
Total power      : 1.87e-02 W (18.7 mW)
Supply voltage   : 1.80e+00 V
Worstcase voltage: 1.80e+00 V (1.799681V at worst node)
Average voltage  : 1.80e+00 V (1.799981V average)
Average IR drop  : 1.99e-03 V (1.99 mV)
Worstcase IR drop: 3.19e-03 V (3.19 mV)
Percentage drop  : 0.18 %

=== VSS 分析结果 ===

Net              : VSS
Corner           : default (tt_025C_1v80)
Total power      : 1.87e-02 W (18.7 mW)
Supply voltage   : 0.00e+00 V
Worstcase voltage: 4.32e-03 V (4.32 mV ground bounce)
Average voltage  : 3.01e-03 V (3.01 mV average)
Average IR drop  : 3.01e-03 V (3.01 mV)
Worstcase IR drop: 4.32e-03 V (4.32 mV)
Percentage drop  : 0.24 %

=== 总 IR drop ===

口径说明：
  180 mV budget = 10% × VDD(1.8V)，是单轨允许的最大压降。
  VDD worst 和 VSS worst 可能出现在不同物理位置，直接相加是保守上界。

VDD worst-case IR drop:     3.19 mV  (1.8% of 180 mV single-rail budget)
VSS worst-case IR drop:     4.32 mV  (2.4% of 180 mV single-rail budget)
Worst single-rail:          4.32 mV  (VSS, 2.4% of budget)
Conservative combined:      7.51 mV  (VDD+VSS worst-case sum, assumes co-occurrence)
IR drop budget (10% VDD):   180 mV (per-rail)
Margin (worst single-rail): 175.7 mV headroom (97.6% margin)

=== 与估算值对比 ===

| 方法              | IR drop   | 来源              |
|-------------------|-----------|-------------------|
| 手算估算 (16-5c)  | ~43 mV    | I×R, R=3Ω 估算    |
| 真实求解 (17-6)   | 7.51 mV   | analyze_power_grid|
| 误差              | 5.7×      | 估算过于保守      |

> 估算值偏高的原因: 手算假设 met1 rail 电阻 3Ω，但实际电源网格
> 是 met4×met5 mesh，电阻远低于 1Ω。4 个 C4 bump 的分布也有效
> 缩短了电流路径。

=== 电源网格连接性 ===

[INFO PSM-0040] All shapes on net VDD are connected. ✅
[INFO PSM-0040] All shapes on net VSS are connected. ✅
Error file: 未生成 (无违规) ✅

=== 功耗数据 (来自 16-5a report_power) ===

Total Power:  20.3 mW (report_power, 含峰值)
  - Internal:  12.0 mW (59.1%)
  - Switching:  8.3 mW (40.9%)
  - Leakage:   21.9 nW (0.0%)

注: analyze_power_grid 报告 18.7 mW (稳态), report_power 报告
20.3 mW (含峰值活动)。差异来自不同的活动因子假设。
IR drop 分析用的是稳态 18.7 mW，已含足够 margin。

============================================
Summary
============================================
| Metric              | Value        | Status |
|---------------------|--------------|--------|
| Total Power         | 20.3 mW      | ✅     |
| Peak Power          | 25.9 mW      | ✅     |
| Power Grid          | All connected| ✅     |
| VDD IR Drop (real)  | 3.19 mV      | ✅     |
| VSS IR Drop (real)  | 4.32 mV      | ✅     |
| Worst single-rail   | 4.32 mV      | ✅     |
| Conservative combined| 7.51 mV     | ✅     |
| IR Drop Budget      | 180 mV (per-rail, 10% VDD) | ✅ |
| Margin (worst rail) | 175.7 mV (97.6%) | ✅ |
| Leakage             | 21.9 nW      | ✅     |

Conclusion: Real IR drop analysis confirms the power grid is
exceptionally robust. Worst single-rail IR drop is 4.32 mV (VSS),
only 2.4% of the 180 mV per-rail budget. The conservative combined
VDD+VSS (7.51 mV, assuming co-occurrence) equals 2.1% of the
combined dual-rail budget (360 mV = 10% of each rail).
Design is power-signoff ready.
============================================

